              </h3>
              <p className="text-indigo-400 text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-widest mt-1 opacity-60">Aylık bazda onaylanmış harcama hacmi</p>
            </div>

            <div className="flex items-center space-x-2 bg-indigo-500/10 p-1.5 rounded-2xl border border-indigo-500/20">
